# ======================================================================
# RTS Kit map file format  (plain text: edit it in any text editor)
#
# Header (before the tiles):
#   name <text>         shown in the map picker
#   width <n>           tiles across, 8..128
#   height <n>          tiles down,   8..128
#   tiles               then exactly <height> rows of <width> characters:
#                         .  grass      ,  dirt (walkable)
#                         ~  water      #  rock / wall
#                       Rows are read exactly as written: a row may start
#                       with # (rock) - it is NOT a comment inside the grid.
#
# Objects (after the tiles), coordinates are tiles, 0,0 = top-left:
#   base <team> <x> <y>        any building name from BUILDING_STATS
#   barracks <team> <x> <y>    (x, y = the building's top-left tile)
#   worker <team> <x> <y>      any unit name from UNIT_STATS:
#   melee <team> <x> <y>       worker, melee, ranged, ...
#   gold <x> <y> <amount>      a gold node
#   team 0 = player, team 1 = AI. Each team needs at least one building.
#
# Outside the tile grid, lines starting with # and blank lines are comments.
# Mistakes are reported with the file name and line number, and the game
# falls back to the Random map.
# ======================================================================

